   "MOPCON 2026 is coming! 🔥🔥🔥\nThis year's theme is \"From AI to Reality\" — let's bring AI, software, and cutting-edge technology into the real world together and witness the limitless reach of software!\n📅 2026/10/31 (Sat)\n📍 Activity Center, Nanzi Campus, National Kaohsiung University of Science and Technology (100 m on foot from Houjing MRT Station)\nSpeaker lineup ⤵️\nKao Chien-Lung (高見龍): head of Five Times Academy 五倍學院 (website: kaochenlong.com )\nzonble: well-known software engineer (website: zonble.net )\nLet's head south of the Zhuoshui River and join in together!"
